 "metadata": {
  "alignment": "unspecified",
  "description": "r0b0tlab's plug-and-play dual-GB10 vLLM serve of StepFun Step 3.7 Flash NVFP4 (198B sparse MoE vision-language model, ModelOpt NVFP4, fp8 KV): a vLLM dev build (0.1.dev16944) with Ray 2.55.1 and FlashInfer 0.6.11, tensor parallel 2 over Ray, native FlashInfer-CUTLASS NVFP4 (no Marlin or emulation), step3p5 reasoning and tool parsers, eager execution. Upstream README profile: 65,536 token context, 4 sequences, 0.90 memory utilization; it validated 32K context and reports about 16.5 tok/s single-stream decode (upstream claims, not measured here). Licences: Apache-2.0 for the model and the package (information only). The image serves the model under the name /models/Step-3.7-Flash-NVFP4, as upstream's examples do.",
